OL,3,GNEWSAResidents' views sought on changes
OL,4,Ato homes plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FA West Sussex council has opened a
OL,7,Fseven-week consultation into changes to
OL,8,Fits local plan, which outlines future
OL,9,Fdevelopment.
OL,11,FHorsham District Council is consulting
OL,12,Fon what it calls a small number of
OL,13,Fmodifications to the plan already
OL,14,Fassessed by a planning inspector.
OL,16,FAccording to the local authority, the
OL,17,Finspector has indicated he is satisfied
OL,18,Fthe local plan is sound in relation to
OL,19,Fhousing numbers, affordable housing
OL,20,Fprovision, and the distribution of
OL,21,Fgrowth across the district.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,330,320,200,140,0,100
