OL,3,GNEWSAResidents' views sought on changes
OL,4,Ato homes plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FCabinet member for planning and
OL,7,Finfrastructure, Ruth Fletcher, called
OL,8,Fthis an "important milestone" in
OL,9,Fbringing the council back to "plan-led
OL,10,Fdevelopment".
